flowchart TB
  classDef event fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#1a73e8,color:#102a43
  classDef read fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#188038,color:#102a43
  classDef state fill:#fef7e0,stroke:#b06000,color:#4a2c00
  classDef writer fill:#fce8e6,stroke:#c5221f,color:#4a1010
  classDef external fill:#f3e8fd,stroke:#7b1fa2,color:#2b0c3d
  classDef hold fill:#f1f3f4,stroke:#5f6368,color:#202124

  event[GitHub event or schedule]:::event
  event --> intake{Event family and trust context}:::event

  subgraph intake_lanes[Entry and routing lanes]
    intake --> pr[PR / review / comment lifecycle]:::read
    intake --> issue[Issue / trusted command lifecycle]:::read
    intake --> schedule[Scheduled or manual control-plane work]:::read
    intake --> dispatch[Bounded dispatch or reusable workflow]:::state
  end

  subgraph autonomous_lanes[Autonomous development lanes]
    pr --> gates[Repository gates and advisory security]:::read
    issue --> triage[Issue triage and bounded agent lanes]:::state
    pr --> peers[Peer-provider review orchestration]:::state
    peers --> secondpass[Verified second-pass review dispatch]:::state
    triage --> router[Role-aware model router]:::state
    router --> modelrun[Bounded Gemini or OpenRouter work]:::external
    schedule --> ops[Read-only operations and scorecard reports]:::read
    schedule --> reconcile[Relationship, fork, Wiki, and surface reconciliation]:::writer
    dispatch --> dependency[Dependency/project phase automation]:::state
  end

  gates --> evidence[(Checks, summaries, artifacts, state markers)]:::read
  triage --> evidence
  peers --> evidence
  modelrun --> evidence
  ops --> evidence
  reconcile --> evidence
  dependency --> evidence

  evidence --> outcome{Outcome and authority boundary}:::event
  outcome --> pass[Pass / advisory result / reviewable state]:::read
  outcome --> wait[Pending evidence, cooldown, quota, or retry wait]:::state
  outcome --> mutate[Fixed-scope attributable writer mutation]:::writer
  outcome --> hold[Reject, skip, circuit-break, or separate acceptance hold]:::hold

  mutate --> postcheck{Postcondition verified?}:::writer
  postcheck -->|yes| pass
  postcheck -->|no| rollback[Bounded rollback or frozen writer lane]:::writer

  linkStyle default stroke:#5f6368,stroke-width:1.5px
